+    // SA-nx: the timing log. Every five seconds, where the game thread's time went: running the
+    // game, drawing its display lists (and, inside that, waiting for the GPU), putting frames on
+    // the screen, and sleeping because it was ahead of real time. Whatever is left is the game.
+    static std::uint64_t ns_since(std::chrono::steady_clock::time_point t) {
